 no open tabs, it shows Add Tab at the top and lists the Add Tab actions, such as Changes, Files, Browser, and Search, with their keybindings. Press Tab to reach the list, use the Up and Down arrow keys to move between actions, and press Enter or Space to open one. For an action with a submenu, such as Canvas, press Enter, Space, or the Right arrow key to open the submenu, the Up and Down arrow keys to choose an item, and the Left arrow key or Escape to return to the list.\"));"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":218,"deletions":10,"truncated":true,"file_count":10},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:14:34.837762+00:00"}